    <worksheet name='PIB Real (FMI) Gráfico'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='12'>Proyección del PIB Real y crecimiento económico por país</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Book' fontsize='10'>Evolución del PIB Real y variación interanual proyectada, 2025–2031</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>En la base de datos y la API del Fondo Monetario Internacional (FMI) —específicamente en las estadísticas del informe de Perspectivas de la Economía Mundial (</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' italic='true'>World Economic Outlook</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> o WEO)—, utilizamos el código </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>NGDP_R</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> significa </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Gross Domestic Product, Constant Prices</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> (en español: </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Producto Interno Bruto a precios constantes</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>, comúnmente conocido como </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>PIB real</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>).</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='indicadores_economicos (spo.indicadores_economicos) (postgres) (2)' name='federated.0hdi9vz03fdxxg1ghueh41csx5sd' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.0hdi9vz03fdxxg1ghueh41csx5sd'>
            <column caption='PIB Real (MM)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_0614688845611014]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='([valor] * [trm_usd]) / 1000000' />
            </column>
            <column caption='Crecimiento PIB %' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_0614688849633287]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF ISNULL(SUM([Calculation_0614688845611014]))&#13;&#10;   OR ISNULL(LOOKUP(SUM([Calculation_0614688845611014]), -1))&#13;&#10;   OR LOOKUP(SUM([Calculation_0614688845611014]), -1) = 0&#13;&#10;THEN&#13;&#10;    NULL&#13;&#10;ELSE&#13;&#10;    SUM([Calculation_0614688845611014])&#13;&#10;    /&#13;&#10;    LOOKUP(SUM([Calculation_0614688845611014]), -1)&#13;&#10;    - 1&#13;&#10;END'>
                <table-calc ordering-type='Rows' />
              </calculation>
            </column>
            <column caption='Fecha' datatype='date' name='[fecha]' role='dimension' type='ordinal' />
            <column-instance column='[pais]' derivation='None' name='[none:pais:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
            <column caption='Pais' datatype='string' name='[pais]' role='dimension' semantic-role='[Country].[ISO3166_2]' type='nominal' />
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_0614688845611014]' derivation='Sum' name='[sum:Calculation_0614688845611014:qk]' pivot='key' type='quantitative' />
            <column caption='Trm Usd' datatype='real' name='[trm_usd]' role='measure' type='quantitative' />
